---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import { siteConfig, getWhatsAppUrl } from '../data/content';
---

<Layout
  title="Tentang Kami - Ruang Rimba Outbound"
  description="Mengenal Ruang Rimba Outbound: profil fasilitator profesional, nilai perusahaan, metodologi experiential learning, dan dedikasi pada keselamatan kegiatan outdoor."
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Tentang Kami' }]} />
  </div>

  <!-- Hero Profil -->
  <section class="bg-[#173D32] text-white py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E8DFC9]">Profil Perusahaan</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">
          Menghubungkan Manusia, Tim, dan Kearifan Alam Raya.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#E8DFC9] leading-relaxed">
          Ruang Rimba Outbound hadir sebagai mitra profesional bagi organisasi, perusahaan, dan institusi pendidikan dalam membangun sinergi tim serta pengembangan karakter melalui pembelajaran luar ruang yang terstruktur dan aman.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Nilai & Keunggulan -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white border-b border-[#E8DFC9]">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#657A50] block mb-2">Nilai Inti Bisnis</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#173D32]">Prinsip yang Kami Junjung Tinggi</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F7F2] border border-[#E8DFC9] space-y-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#173D32] text-[#E8DFC9] flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#173D32]">Safety First Standard</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Keselamatan adalah prioritas yang tidak dapat ditawar. Seluruh modul kegiatan, wahana permainan, dan jalur petualangan kami telah melalui asesmen risiko ketat dengan dukungan tim paramedis.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F7F2] border border-[#E8DFC9] space-y-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#173D32] text-[#E8DFC9] flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#173D32]">Reflective Learning</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Outbound bukan semata-mata berlari atau tertawa. Kami menekankan sesi debriefing terarah agar setiap peserta mampu memetik nilai reflektif yang relevan dengan dinamika kerja tim nyata.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F7F2] border border-[#E8DFC9] space-y-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[#173D32] text-[#E8DFC9] flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#173D32]">Ecological Respect</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Menjunjung etika <em>Leave No Trace</em>. Kami mendidik setiap peserta untuk menjaga kebersihan alam hutan rimba, meminimalkan sampah plastik, dan menghargai ekosistem lokal.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Visi & Misi -->
  <section class="py-16 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#657A50] block">Visi & Misi</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#173D32] leading-tight">
          Menjadi Katalis Pertumbuhan Sumber Daya Manusia Indonesia.
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E8DFC9]">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#173D32] mb-1">Visi Kami</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Menjadi penyedia jasa outbound dan wisata petualangan terkemuka di Indonesia yang diakui atas profesionalisme fasilitator, keaslian konten edukatif, serta standar operasional keselamatan kelas utama.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E8DFC9]">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#173D32] mb-1">Misi Kami</h3>
            <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside leading-relaxed">
              <li>Merancang program outdoor learning yang menyenangkan, bermakna, dan berdampak nyata.</li>
              <li>Menyediakan pelayanan terpadu (all-in) yang mempermudah panitia acara perusahaan.</li>
              <li>Mengembangkan jejaring destinasi wisata alam yang memberdayakan masyarakat lokal.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#E8DFC9]">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517486808906-6ca8b3f04846?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop"
          alt="Tim Fasilitator Ruang Rimba"
          class="w-full h-[420px] object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Prosedur Pemesanan -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-[#F8F7F2] border-t border-[#E8DFC9]">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#657A50] block mb-2">Alur Kerjasama</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#173D32]">Langkah Mudah Merancang Kegiatan Anda</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-[#E8DFC9] space-y-2">
          <span class="text-2xl font-black text-[#657A50]">01</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#173D32]">Konsultasi Awal</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Sampaikan perkiraan jumlah peserta, tanggal tentatif, target kegiatan, dan preferensi lokasi.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-[#E8DFC9] space-y-2">
          <span class="text-2xl font-black text-[#657A50]">02</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#173D32]">Proposal & Penawaran</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Kami menyusun rancangan rundown detail, pilihan paket, dan kalkulasi anggaran transparan.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-[#E8DFC9] space-y-2">
          <span class="text-2xl font-black text-[#657A50]">03</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#173D32]">Survei & Finalisasi</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Dampingan survei venue lokasi bila diperlukan, penandatanganan kesepakatan, dan DP operasional.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-[#E8DFC9] space-y-2">
          <span class="text-2xl font-black text-[#657A50]">04</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-[#173D32]">Eksekusi & Evaluasi</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Pelaksanaan event oleh Master Game terlatih, serah terima dokumentasi foto/video, dan feedback.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Hubungi Kami -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-[#F8F7F2]">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="bg-[#173D32] rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-14 text-white shadow-2xl border-2 border-[#657A50]/40 relative overflow-hidden">
        
        <!-- Background accent subtle -->
        <div class="absolute -right-16 -bottom-16 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-[#657A50]/20 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute -left-16 -top-16 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-6">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#657A50]/40 border border-[#657A50] text-[#E8DFC9] text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
            Konsultasi Acara & Gathering
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight">
            Ingin Diskusi Langsung dengan Tim Kami?
          </h2>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#E8DFC9] leading-relaxed">
            Kami siap mendengarkan visi kegiatan Anda dan memberikan solusi serta estimasi anggaran terbaik tanpa biaya konsultasi.
          </p>

          <div class="pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
            <a
              href={getWhatsAppUrl("Halo Batu Highland Outbound, saya ingin berkonsultasi mengenai profil layanan dan paket acara kami.")}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-[#657A50] hover:bg-[#657A50]/90 text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-xl transition hover:scale-105 active:scale-95"
            >
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-300" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.587-5.946.003-6.556 5.338-11.891 11.893-11.891 3.181.001 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.48 8.414-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892-1.99-.001-3.951-.5-5.688-1.448l-6.305 1.654zm6.597-3.807c1.676.995 3.276 1.591 5.392 1.592 5.448 0 9.886-4.434 9.889-9.885.002-5.462-4.415-9.89-9.881-9.892-5.452 0-9.887 4.434-9.889 9.884-.001 2.225.651 3.891 1.746 5.634l-.999 3.648 3.742-.981z"/></svg>
              Chat WhatsApp Sekarang
            </a>
            <a
              href="/kontak"
              class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-4 rounded-xl border border-[#E8DFC9] text-[#E8DFC9] hover:bg-white/10 font-bold text-sm transition text-center"
            >
              Hubungi via Form
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
